agraph\" >Clickable floor tiles can be swept clean, or conceal an angry dust bunny to avoid. Place caution signs and tread carefully using classic Minesweeper strategies\u2014but watch out! Tiles and numbers may not be as they seem as hazardous materials emerge throughout the night! Characters with unique play styles and 20 ascension levels ensure you can customize your experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/c06159fe81522cc131d076cd13b5c33e.poster.avif?t=1770281956\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/c06159fe81522cc131d076cd13b5c33e.webm?t=1770281956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/c06159fe81522cc131d076cd13b5c33e.mp4?t=1770281956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Ludicrous Item Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop by a vending machine to restock your janitor cart with items to help you combat the forces lurking in TentaTeq\u2019s maze of cubicles. Defeat bosses to earn powerful keys that grant you new abilities that upend the way you solve puzzles. Discover limitless wacky combinations as you search for the synergy you need to avoid getting fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgic 90s-Style Pixel Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in simpler technological times, with 5 characters, 7 bosses, 100+ items, and millions of tentacles rendered in a quirky pixel art style. Mysterious events reveal unsettling and insidious corporate secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/8aba1690204bd1838a5d07012f780306.poster.avif?t=1770281956\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/8aba1690204bd1838a5d07012f780306.webm?t=1770281956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/extras/8aba1690204bd1838a5d07012f780306.mp4?t=1770281956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you uncover at the heart of TentaTeq, Inc.\u2019s towering monument to industry? Can you ascend the increasingly challenging floors and keep your job until morning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BandsWithLegends"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473250/0a3d71125bfdd36fab82c6c56218a1dda5df7e94/header.jpg?t=1770281956","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Bandwidth Games, LLC. 2024-2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Deck</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Deck</li></ul>